      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm looking at a ticket for order #88291. Customer says their ceramic vase arrived shattered and they're demanding a full refund right now. I know our goal is to keep CSAT high but also keep costs down by flagging suspicious claims. Based on the carrier sensor data for this shipment and what the customer is saying, what's the most efficient way to handle this so we don't lose the customer but also don't waste money on unnecessary refunds?",
